We set up a small app, defined routes, and returned JSON and plain text. Now we'll add middleware, headers, cookies, and redirects. Middleware.

## [Helpers](https://hono.dev/docs/guides/helpers)

# Helpers [​](https://hono.dev/docs/guides/helpers#helpers)
```
import { getCookie, setCookie } from 'hono/cookie'

